{:name "tenancy-admin"
 :version "1.0.0"
 :description "Tenancy addon control-plane UI — org-admin panels served via the route-collection seam. Loaded ONLY when the addon is active (`:extra-package-names`); references the addon's `:grant`/`:org`/… entities, so its base-fns throw without the addon schema."
 ;; Depends on `app` for the route templates (`:get-auth-required`, `:post`)
 ;; and HTML primitives, on `web` for `:router-or-nil`, on `core` for the
 ;; hiccup/collection primitives. `app` does NOT depend on this package —
 ;; the dependency is one-way, so core syncs without the addon.
 :dependencies ["core" "web" "app"]
 :modules ["grants" "users" "registration" "my-app" "router"]}
